# Normalize line endings.
#
# `text=auto` lets Git decide per-file based on content, with LF in the repo
# and the platform's native EOL in the working tree.
#
# Shell scripts must stay LF even on Windows checkouts: when they are
# bind-mounted (docker-compose.local.yml) or COPY'd into a Linux container,
# CRLF makes the kernel reject the shebang with `bad interpreter: /usr/bin/env\r`.

* text=auto

*.sh text eol=lf
docker-entrypoint.sh text eol=lf
